WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.806 --> 00:00:09.198
1. Open Billing from the menu in your account.

2
00:00:09.198 --> 00:00:13.595
2. Choose Unpaid to see only the invoices that are due.

3
00:00:13.595 --> 00:00:24.159
3. Click Pay next to the invoice you want to pay.

4
00:00:24.159 --> 00:00:33.049
4. The invoice opens in our secure client area. Choose a payment method and confirm.
